{"id":"vod_md_3216","vodId":"3216","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"罪恶王冠","name_cn":"罪恶王冠","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"22集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230825-1/c4ba66a44cefb2cbe976fa2f5643386b.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在2029年，被病毒袭击的日本陷入了混乱之后被名为“GHQ”的暴力组织全面接手，政府逐渐成为了傀儡。在这样动荡的大环境下，樱满集（梶裕贵 配音）只是一名平凡的高中生，过着属于他的平凡生活，直到那个叫做楪祈（茅野爱衣 配音）的少女出现在他的眼前。祈的真实身份为“葬仪社”的成员，这个社团以从GHQ的手上夺回日本自治权为目标不断进行着危险而残酷的战争。在组织首领恙神涯（中村悠一 配音）的引导之下，集成为了组织的一员，结识了同僚筱宫绫濑（花泽香菜 配音）和鸫（竹达彩奈 配音）等人。随着战斗的升级，各种迹象显示出集似乎拥有着神秘的力量，而躲在诸多敌人背后的究竟是怎样强大的存在，众人无从而知……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-25 08:26:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/l3O6mNcC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/9VH7gY9U/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/d6pb7I7F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/SmHUdthT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/1QRhRhhP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/MSpv4UFK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/DXDckXVA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/NKwYzpCm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/rSOtm3zl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/JVe1YlNi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/8MKlOPpb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/spQiiyZu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/OV2Goh5C/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/1WbEf3g9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/SfBx1jCi/index.m3u8"